# Parameter definitions for thorn TestPersistentGroups

# The stamp unit is derived from CarpetX::max_num_levels, which is read by
# name (CCTK_ParameterGet)

BOOLEAN check_past_after_regrid "Check the past timelevel of persist_history at POSTREGRID. Turn off where a regrid follows a recovery before level 0 steps again: the recovered past timelevel is valid on the interior only (SYNC does not cover the oldest timelevel), and a regrid carries a non-evolved timelevel only from a coarse level on which it is valid everywhere, so the regrid drops it on the refined levels." STEERABLE=recover
{
} yes
